Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.14,0:00:03.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.90,0:00:05.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡跟克劳力搭伙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass is chumming it up with Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.29,0:00:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在一起追踪路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're hunting Lucifer together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:09.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  一个天使  一个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right -- one's an angel, one's a demon,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.40,0:00:11.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还一起破案\N{\fnArial\fs30}and apparently, they solve crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.48,0:00:14.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法现在是烂摇滚大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Lucifer is now the Master of Butt Rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.58,0:00:16.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他跳进了文斯·文森特的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}He jumped into Vince Vincente.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.34,0:00:18.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-那个摇滚明星  -混蛋差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The rock star? - The douchebag.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.32,0:00:20.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他以前留长紫发及腚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy used to roll with purple hair down to his butt
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.01,0:00:21.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还穿带尖刺的护挡\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a spiked codpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.16,0:00:23.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-那是80年代嘛  -你还替他说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was the '80s. - What, are you defending him?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.27,0:00:25.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  他第三张专辑还挺...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I mean, his third album was kind of...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:28.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-不那么差劲  -我现在恨死你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- not horrible. - I hate you so much right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.58,0:00:30.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我见识过文斯的各种样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'v'een around all stripes of Vince, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.22,0:00:31.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,醉酒的文斯  抑郁的文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drunk Vince, depressed Vince,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.72,0:00:34.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,夸大狂的"我是金上帝"的文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}megalomaniacal "I'm a Golden God" Vince.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.03,0:00:36.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但把我从门里丢出去的文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Vince who threw me through that door...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.32,0:00:37.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}that wasn't him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.53,0:00:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你有他的消息  一定给我来电\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you hear from him, don't hesitate to call.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.48,0:00:44.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的...碧昂斯探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Agent...Beyoncé.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.31,0:00:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这么跳皮囊我都腻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This vessel hopping's getting old.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.24,0:00:50.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚习惯了一具肉身的限制\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as I get used to the limitations of one meatsack,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.24,0:00:52.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就得弃船  再跳进另一具不完美的身体里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta cut bait and jump to the next flawed lump.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.97,0:00:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是要我把这具皮囊弄成永久性的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you want me to make this vessel permanent?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.44,0:00:56.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,足够强大  能支撑住你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strong enough to hold you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.79,0:00:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是挺合适我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does look good on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.35,0:01:01.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.72,0:01:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小红  你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red, what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.74,0:01:11.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加速了腐败  陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sped up the decaying process, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.43,0:01:12.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,红发贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ginger bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.67,0:01:15.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你休想毁掉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't destroy me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.31,0:01:19.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在还不行  但我可以送你去很远的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet, but I can send you far, far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.54,0:01:22.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去海底找新皮囊吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try finding a new vessel at the bottom of the bloody ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.24,0:01:24.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.23,0:01:29.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.27,0:01:38.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-黑暗领主  -恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dark Lord. - Apollyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.86,0:01:42.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.95,0:01:40.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,魔王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beelzebub.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.67,0:01:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,作为您卑微的仆人  我们恳求您\N{\fnArial\fs30}As your humble servants, we beseech thee.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.42,0:01:46.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们呼唤您的名字  召唤您\N{\fnArial\fs30}We say your names as summonings.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.10,0:01:47.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现身吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show thyself!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.96,0:01:50.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-毒蛇  -魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Serpent. - Devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.06,0:01:53.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法  现身吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer! Show thyself!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.40,0:01:55.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我沐浴于您的荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rain your splendor upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用您罪恶的愤怒滋润我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me bathe in your unholy wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.01,0:02:03.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,浸湿我吧  路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drench me, Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.28,0:02:05.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别闹了  科迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut it out, Gordy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.15,0:02:11.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥们  这不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, it's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.66,0:02:15.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥们  你让路西法"浸湿"你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, you asked Lucifer to drench you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.36,0:02:16.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又不是我写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't write it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.71,0:02:18.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是美国撒旦崇拜者协会认证的召唤文\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a Satanist Society of America-approved summoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.86,0:02:19.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在网上查到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found it online.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.91,0:02:22.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  还有那件"宝物"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, like you found that "artifact."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.09,0:02:24.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,承认吧  亚当  你的"撒旦羽毛"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Face it, Adam, your "Satan feather,"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.44,0:02:27.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比我继母从唐人街买来的包包还山寨\N{\fnArial\fs30}is faker than my stepmom's Chinatown Fendi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.07,0:02:28.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是真的  -就是块石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's real. - It's a rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.57,0:02:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,石化了  这是路西法翅膀的羽毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's fossilized. A feather from Lucifer's wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.61,0:02:33.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卖家是从他的一个地宫中挖掘出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The seller excavated it from one of his crypts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.83,0:02:35.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法还有"地宫"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer has "crypts."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.53,0:02:37.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法还有"翅膀"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer has "wings."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.28,0:02:39.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你蠢死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so frickin' dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.58,0:02:41.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.66,0:02:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在找那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been looking for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.55,0:02:50.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.31,0:02:52.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绝不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No freakin' --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.88,0:02:57.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.18,0:02:58.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.08,0:03:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成功了  我的召唤...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-it worked! My summoning actually --
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.56,0:03:03.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"召唤"了我的  是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing that "summoned" me was this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.94,0:03:07.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这具皮囊已经不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This vessel was already wearing out,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.86,0:03:11.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的海底之旅更是帮了倒忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my trip under the sea did not help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.08,0:03:14.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,补充一点能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a little power up...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.33,0:03:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坚持不了多久  但也能凑合了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't last long, but it'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.08,0:03:34.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和你的...伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, you and your...pal,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.79,0:03:37.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们是我如今典型的人间追随者吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}are you typical of my following on Earth these days?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.57,0:03:38.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为...\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.50,0:03:41.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不不  你不可能是路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no, no. You can't be Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.81,0:03:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是文斯·文森特  我妈可喜欢你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Vince Vincente. My mom loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.96,0:03:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你...还算有名\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're...kinda famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.70,0:03:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还算有名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kinda famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.09,0:04:00.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第12季第7集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.38,0:04:06.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.93,0:04:16.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"电臀舞"  瞧好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Twerking." Booyah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.28,0:04:21.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(这哪叫词)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.76,0:04:25.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(自己查字典)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.27,0:04:27.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.95,0:04:28.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.44,0:04:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在查英国记录者的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I've been trying to dig up info on the British Men of Letters,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.20,0:04:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,留意是否有案件出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}keeping an eye out for cases,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.87,0:04:34.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而你则游手好闲\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you've been goofing off
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.35,0:04:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,玩一个五年前就不流行了的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a game that went out of style five years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.80,0:04:39.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得妈妈还没准备好玩阅后即焚呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think Mom's quite ready for Snapchat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.00,0:04:41.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你在跟妈妈对战  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're playing against Mom? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.96,0:04:42.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是一个月前还不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same Mom that didn't know
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.97,0:04:44.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,电话是什么物的妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}what a cellphone was a month ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.84,0:04:46.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.61,0:04:48.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不太公平吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't exactly seem like a fair fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.48,0:04:51.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(超级词)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.01,0:04:55.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚说什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.60,0:04:59.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她最近如何了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how she been lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.49,0:05:03.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挺好的  她还在应对\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's good. You know, she -- she's dealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.79,0:05:05.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(小卡)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.46,0:05:06.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.50,0:05:07.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.91,0:05:10.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还在跟克劳力演80年代兄弟喜剧吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still living out an '80s buddy comedy with Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.65,0:05:13.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很遗憾是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.66,0:05:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有路西法的消息吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any news on Lucifer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.95,0:05:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有的  看新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, yes. Look at the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.37,0:05:18.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(搜索提示  文斯·文森特)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.06,0:05:20.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,稍等\N{\fnArial\fs30}One sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.67,0:05:23.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(黑暗领主  重金属新闻  美女心:微金属不死)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.86,0:05:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(美女心与死亡警报唱片签约)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.17,0:05:27.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.31,0:05:29.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是今天的新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is from today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.49,0:05:31.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们站在死亡警报唱片门前\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here in front of DeathSiren Records...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.69,0:05:32.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.95,0:05:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-不可能  -采访文斯·文森特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no friggin' way. - ...with Vince Vincente.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.90,0:05:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  很高兴能够重组乐队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it's, uh, it's great having the band back together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.74,0:05:38.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在录音棚里  精神百倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the studio, feeling pumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.92,0:05:40.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好久没这么有劲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't felt this fired up in ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.37,0:05:43.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很多人认为  你的摇滚风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of people saying that your style of rock
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.35,0:05:45.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在当今的气候下是不可能东山再起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}could never make a comeback in today's landscape.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.57,0:05:46.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.55,0:05:50.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下地狱去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.62,0:05:54.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-告诉我那不是路西法  -我们不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell me that's not Lucifer. - We don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.08,0:05:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  你不是说罗威娜伤到了他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, I-I thought you said Rowena got some licks in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.12,0:05:59.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他这会儿不该把皮囊用坏了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't he have burned through his vessel by now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.33,0:06:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  但我们不确定...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but we don't know. We don't --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.73,0:06:04.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  小子们  好久没见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, boys. Long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.40,0:06:06.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们组队救世界来着  然后就没然后了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We team up to save the world, and then bupkis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.35,0:06:07.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们不打电话  不写信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't call, you don't write.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.68,0:06:10.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我们不在乎  -克劳力  路西法呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, we don't care. - Crowley -- Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.76,0:06:12.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法  想想看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer. Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.64,0:06:14.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么多消亡的摇滚乐队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of all the extinct rock acts,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.65,0:06:16.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美女心是最古旧的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladyheart are the most Paleolithic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.81,0:06:17.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如今  2016年\N{\fnArial\fs30}A major label
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.52,0:06:20.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会有大唱片公司复活这帮恐龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}sponsored comeback in 2016 for those dinosaurs?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.46,0:06:24.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉不太自然  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't feel like a wholly natural turn of events, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.35,0:06:27.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许路西法想到了办法治愈他的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Lucifer found a way to heal his vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.12,0:06:29.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是...搞什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but still... I mean, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.19,0:06:31.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在洛杉矶  我们那里见\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in L.A. I'll see you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.42,0:06:33.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,洛杉矶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, L.A.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.64,0:06:35.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.86,0:06:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.48,0:06:40.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认识个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.16,0:06:42.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(好莱坞)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.02,0:06:48.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(贝弗利山)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.55,0:06:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(死亡警报唱片)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.11,0:07:06.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好  罗素\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Russell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.91,0:07:09.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.93,0:07:13.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,稍等  我收个尾  很快的\N{\fnArial\fs30}One moment. Just let me tie this off real quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.60,0:07:16.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.32,0:07:18.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.02,0:07:22.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为何会来到天使之城\N{\fnArial\fs30}what brings you to the City of... Angels?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.84,0:07:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你清楚这是我的城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know this is my city.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.84,0:07:27.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你搞这套精神领袖的破玩意做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with all this Maharishi crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.17,0:07:30.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去年搬去了西区\N{\fnArial\fs30}I moved to the Westside last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.27,0:07:34.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始每日冥想  做瑜伽  喝绿色果汁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Started daily meditation, yoga, green juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.44,0:07:38.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能帮我克制自大  和愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helps to keep the ego and the anger in check.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.21,0:07:40.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不说我了  你最近如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}But enough about me. How you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.80,0:07:42.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,健康  家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Health? Family?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.09,0:07:44.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.41,0:07:47.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无所谓  不在乎  不如往日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't matter, don't care, and been better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.89,0:07:50.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, good news. Good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.06,0:07:53.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有几个不错的新秀给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a couple of quality up-and-comers for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.68,0:07:56.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,渴求成功的年轻才俊  唾手可得的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirsty young talent. Souls ripe for the taking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.30,0:08:02.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还满意我们的...安排吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been pleased with our...arrangement so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.06,0:08:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}As punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.46,0:08:06.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,灵魂就是灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}A soul's a soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.80,0:08:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是能拥有一个斯威夫特\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there is a certain prestige
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.26,0:08:11.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或德雷克是挺长脸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to owning a Swift or a Drake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.99,0:08:12.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.58,0:08:15.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,德瑞博士给的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a gift from Dre.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.90,0:08:22.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,文斯·文森特回归的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole Vince Vincente comeback thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.75,0:08:24.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是开玩笑的吧  -不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a joke, right? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.79,0:08:26.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常认真的  朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deadly serious, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.71,0:08:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其他的过去都能被我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've raided, repackaged, and resold
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.95,0:08:30.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿来  重包装  再出售\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything else from our past.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.72,0:08:32.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不能给微金属个第二次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not give hair metal another shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.50,0:08:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我也是有怀疑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay. I doubted it, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.07,0:08:38.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但文斯向我提出了一个很棒的提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Vince came to me with a killer pitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.00,0:08:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把最初的美女心成员重新召集起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The original Ladyheart lineup reunited.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.24,0:08:46.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想当年  他们卖过一千万呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back in the day, those cats sold, like, 10 mil.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.55,0:08:48.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,胡蒂与河豚也辉煌过\N{\fnArial\fs30}So did Hootie & the Blowfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.10,0:08:50.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也会让他们回归的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll bring them back, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.90,0:08:52.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道美女心可能会成为笑柄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know Ladyheart might be a punch line,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.64,0:08:56.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他们乐队的认知率爆表\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the band's got off-the-chart name recognition.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.71,0:08:58.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且光是跟文斯谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And just talking to Vince,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.80,0:09:00.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他感觉不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he seemed different, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.70,0:09:03.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很有精神  重焕生机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Energized. Reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.35,0:09:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,容光焕发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.96,0:09:06.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像个全新的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a whole new man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.32,0:09:08.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.99,0:09:20.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  离洛杉矶还有450英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. 450 miles to L.A.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.60,0:09:23.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到处交通堵塞  遍地肉毒素\N{\fnArial\fs30}Land of gridlock, Botox,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.81,0:09:25.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,征税过重  眼高手低\N{\fnArial\fs30}overtaxing, underachieving,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.82,0:09:28.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汗味和绝望臭气熏天\N{\fnArial\fs30}smell of sweaty desperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.47,0:09:30.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无法呼吸  海滩有毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you can't breathe. The beaches are toxic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.69,0:09:33.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有穿瘦腿牛仔裤  在室内戴墨镜的傻逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got dudes in skinny jeans wearing sunglasses inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.02,0:09:38.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和痴迷于形象的自恋狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Image-obsessed narcissists.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.89,0:09:40.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我喜欢瑜伽裤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do like the yoga pants, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.21,0:09:43.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们多久没去过洛杉矶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When was the last time we were in L.A.?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.00,0:09:46.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,10年前  杀复仇鬼的时候吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}About 10 years ago, doing a vengeful spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.24,0:09:49.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉像是过了一辈子  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, that seems like forever ago. Doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.40,0:09:56.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟你说话呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tryin' to talk to you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.90,0:09:58.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-什么  -你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - You...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.30,0:09:59.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you listenin' to?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.22,0:10:01.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,播客  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, podcast. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.42,0:10:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.30,0:10:06.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要点东西保持清醒  放大声点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need something to keep me awake, so crank it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.40,0:10:10.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是历史主题的播客\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's a history podcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.20,0:10:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I like history, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.57,0:10:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,角斗士  法外之徒  海盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gladiators and outlaws, pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.16,0:10:20.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们开的就是件历史遗物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, we're driving a piece of history right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.95,0:10:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是那种历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}N-not that kind of history.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.34,0:10:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.18,0:10:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是关于宗教改革历史的播客\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a podcast on the history of the Protestant Reformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.86,0:10:29.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,分部探究\N{\fnArial\fs30}A multipart exploration
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.18,0:10:31.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,讨论马丁·路德的95篇论文\N{\fnArial\fs30}of each of Martin Luther's 95 theses.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.60,0:10:33.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我也觉得你不会喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.25,0:10:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆  -哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam. - Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.28,0:10:45.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,微摇滚  不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hair rock? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.02,0:10:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-不是微...  -拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not hair - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.07,0:10:47.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是微摇滚  迪恩  是重摇滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not hair rock, Dean. It's hard rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.90,0:10:49.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是真真正正的重摇滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's legitimate hard rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.98,0:10:52.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人不可貌相  海水不可斗量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't judge a book by its cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.37,0:10:55.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  不能看到彩虹假发和豹纹就对人妄下结论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, or a dude by his, uh, rainbow wig and leopard prints.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.75,0:10:57.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,彩虹假发  什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rainbow wig? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.27,0:11:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你  我不想再道歉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I'm done apologizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.42,0:11:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法附身了文斯·文森特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer possessed Vince Vincente.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.38,0:11:07.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是文斯·文森特的音乐  听这个也算调研\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Vince Vincente's music, so listening to it is research.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.79,0:11:09.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-不  不  -事实上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. No. - As a matter of fact...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.83,0:11:11.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,研究一下吧  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Study up, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.70,0:11:13.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.19,0:11:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想听\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna listen to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.15,0:11:18.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你喜欢的  -不不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You like it. - No. No. No, no. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.11,0:11:19.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.21,0:11:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会喜欢上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll grow on ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.79,0:11:35.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(死亡警报录音棚)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.46,0:11:37.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你关于美女心回归的推文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your tweet about Ladyheart's reunion
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.32,0:11:39.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已经有一百万多条转发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}already has over a million engagements.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.85,0:11:42.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你独唱时  有300个点赞就不错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you were solo, you were lucky to have 300 "likes."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.31,0:11:44.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乐队在音乐云上发布的前瞻音频\N{\fnArial\fs30}The band's teaser track on SoundCloud?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.38,0:11:47.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,4小时内有50万的点播量\N{\fnArial\fs30}500K streams in 4 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.29,0:11:48.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,消息网刚发了个榜单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buzzfeed just posted a listicle --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.89,0:11:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"关于美女心你需要知道的10件事"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"10 Things You Need to Know About Ladyheart."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.23,0:11:53.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这很棒  文斯  非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is good, Vince. This is really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.85,0:11:56.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-太好了  -要成了  文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Great. - It's happening, Vince.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.67,0:11:58.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们又要名声大振了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we are gonna be famous again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.59,0:12:00.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vince.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.86,0:12:04.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还录不录音了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we actually gonna record or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:12.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没太有感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really feelin' it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.92,0:12:14.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.68,0:12:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乐队已经重组了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The band's back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.48,0:12:19.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有录音的预算\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got an actual recording budget.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.45,0:12:23.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥们  我们来制作音乐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude... let's make some music.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.31,0:12:27.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Music.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.80,0:12:30.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,粉丝们现在在说我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are the fans saying about me right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.82,0:12:33.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在就你昨晚跟帕米·安德森吃饭的事发推\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're tweeting about your drinks with Pam Anderson last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.30,0:12:35.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猜测你俩是不是要旧情复燃\N{\fnArial\fs30}speculating if you two are rekindling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.25,0:12:37.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们还在争论文斯·文森特\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they're debating whether Vince Vincente
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.29,0:12:39.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是帅  恶  还是老了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is bae, nay, or daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.97,0:12:42.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么意思啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell does that even mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.77,0:12:44.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,意思是  音乐不是重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means it's not about the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.04,0:12:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从来都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It never really was.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.66,0:12:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摇滚并不是原因  只是个借口\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, rock's not the reason. It's just an excuse...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.29,0:12:53.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让人崇拜  爱慕\N{\fnArial\fs30}to worship, to adore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.12,0:12:57.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧  人类一直都需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, humans have always been desperate
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.97,0:13:00.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把什么人或什么东西置于他们之上\N{\fnArial\fs30}to put someone or something above them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.70,0:13:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,承认吧  如今  上帝已经不够格了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let's face it, God ain't cuttin' it these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.21,0:13:05.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得要金·卡戴珊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It takes a Kim Kardashian,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.86,0:13:08.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是贾斯汀·比伯那种的才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}a whatever Justin Bieber is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.56,0:13:10.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像我这种的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.76,0:13:16.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们享受这份快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're enjoying the ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.59,0:13:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也该如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}So should you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.36,0:13:43.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(贝拉克酒店)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.33,0:13:50.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.09,0:13:52.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这很好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.99,0:13:54.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是蔬菜水\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's vegetable water.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.96,0:13:56.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.52,0:14:00.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要不要换身衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}You consider switching up your duds there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.38,0:14:01.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在这儿显得太老土了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bit stiff for this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.07,0:14:03.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他可以是个探员之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could be an agent or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.33,0:14:05.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三流探员吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, maybe a third-tier agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.32,0:14:07.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少我不会像个伐木工\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least I don't look like a lumberjack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.46,0:14:11.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,够了  你俩  克劳力呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, enough. Guys, where's Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.03,0:14:13.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说会在这儿碰面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he'd meet us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.38,0:14:15.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老实说  能跟他分开一会儿也好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frankly, I appreciate the break.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.78,0:14:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好几周了  他一直就在我旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been weeks, and he's been right there,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.10,0:14:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,念叨个不停\N{\fnArial\fs30}just talking and talking and talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.49,0:14:22.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无休无止\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's relentless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.85,0:14:25.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别听他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't listen to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.17,0:14:27.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毛毛和我都难舍难分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feathers and I are all but inseparable now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.32,0:14:29.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你有发现吗  -有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You find anything? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.45,0:14:32.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,文斯·文森特被魔鬼附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vince Vincente is riding with the Devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.77,0:14:35.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.31,0:14:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我建议去他房间看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest we go check out his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.49,0:14:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,按计划  文斯今天会一直在录音棚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vince is scheduled to be in the studio all day,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.01,0:14:43.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我们没问题  -钥匙卡哪来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- so we're covered. - How'd you get the card?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.15,0:14:45.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里是洛杉矶  我认识很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is L.A. I know a lot of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.38,0:15:01.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来是发生过打斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, looks like there was some kind of a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.69,0:15:04.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  打得挺投入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Some kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.62,0:15:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.60,0:15:12.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摇滚歌星自传  都集齐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rock star biographies. Like, all of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.11,0:15:14.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从史密斯飞船到ZZ托普\N{\fnArial\fs30}from Aerosmith to ZZ Top.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.21,0:15:17.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他好像在学习如何出名\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like he's studying how to become famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.56,0:15:21.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  路西法成书呆子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, so what, Lucifer's a dork?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.82,0:15:24.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.00,0:15:26.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看啊  "成熟火龙果的种子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this -- "The seeds of a ripe dragon fruit
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.38,0:15:29.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,滴上1盎司的槐花蜜\N{\fnArial\fs30}drizzled with exactly 1 ounce of Acacia honey,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.65,0:15:32.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放在陶瓷碗里  塑料不行"\N{\fnArial\fs30}prepared in a ceramic bowl -- no plastic."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.25,0:15:34.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this spell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.99,0:15:37.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是早餐  是文斯的附加条款\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's breakfast. It's Vince's rider.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.28,0:15:40.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我见过更麻烦的  -我不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've seen worse. - I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.33,0:15:42.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法此刻可以去接管天堂和地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer could be taking over Heaven and Hell right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.70,0:15:45.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果  他却在这里实现摇滚之王的幻想\N{\fnArial\fs30}and instead, he's trying to act out some rock god fantasy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.85,0:15:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  换谁不会啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Who wouldn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.27,0:15:50.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.88,0:15:53.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.20,0:15:56.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,似乎是人的牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appears to be a human tooth
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.27,0:15:57.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,连牙根拽下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}pulled out by the root.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.10,0:16:07.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能问你件事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.50,0:16:11.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么跟我待在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you spending time with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.42,0:16:14.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你那么多年来一直无视我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ignored me for years,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.18,0:16:16.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我倒不是怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}not that I blamed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.66,0:16:19.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我太傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a fool
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.61,0:16:23.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有看清你的痴心\N{\fnArial\fs30}not to recognize such sweet devotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.96,0:16:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我说说  萝丝琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me, Roseleen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.57,0:16:35.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.75,0:16:38.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.40,0:16:41.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Vince.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.12,0:16:43.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,文斯·文森特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vince Vincente.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.66,0:16:48.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从见到你的一刻就知道自己爱上了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I knew I was in love with you the moment I saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.59,0:16:52.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我那时才16  就是阿卡迪亚一个普通少女\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was 16, just a normal kid growing up in Arcadia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.42,0:16:55.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿卡迪亚  好美的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arcadia. Sounds beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.32,0:16:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我当时在看《重金属爱好者舞会》\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was watching "Headbanger's Ball"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.79,0:17:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上面播了《血腥弥赛亚》的MV\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the "Bloody Messiah" video came on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.13,0:17:02.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.73,0:17:06.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.65,0:17:10.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的头发  你的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your hair. And your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.81,0:17:12.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.70,0:17:14.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.68,0:17:16.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就算人们取笑我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And even when people made fun of me --
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.98,0:17:18.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,单位比我小的女生\N{\fnArial\fs30}younger girls at work,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.13,0:17:20.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,取笑我的美人心文身\N{\fnArial\fs30}shredding on my Ladyheart tattoos
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.77,0:17:22.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说你是个笑话\N{\fnArial\fs30}and saying you're a joke --
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.64,0:17:24.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从未停止爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never stopped loving you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.36,0:17:28.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也永远不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I never will.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.26,0:17:31.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有多爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much do you love me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.31,0:17:38.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你愿做什么来表达你的爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you do to show me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.41,0:17:42.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.08,0:17:50.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,任何事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.98,0:17:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你愿流血吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you bleed?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.77,0:18:05.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就流血吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then bleed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.14,0:18:33.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,格林菲尔德太太流血过多\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Mrs. Greenfield has lost a lot of blood
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.01,0:18:35.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伤疤也不可治愈  但她稳定下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there'll be no fixing those scars, but she's stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.77,0:18:39.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她自残的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she cut herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.03,0:18:42.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她将他的名字刻在了胸膛上\N{\fnArial\fs30}She carved his name into her chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.03,0:18:45.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"文斯·文森特"  一个字没漏\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Vince Vincente." Didn't skip a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.82,0:18:47.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且割得很深\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she cut deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.54,0:18:48.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.52,0:18:54.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是那句  搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, again, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.65,0:18:56.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我去跟她谈谈  -不不不  你别去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll go talk to her. - No. No, no, no, you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.68,0:18:58.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  待这儿  看住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, stay here. Keep an eye on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.30,0:19:05.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.55,0:19:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.46,0:19:10.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.45,0:19:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们想搞明白发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wanna understand what happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.56,0:19:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但首先  你得开口\N{\fnArial\fs30}but in order for us to do that, we need you to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.07,0:19:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萝丝琳  是文斯逼你的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roseleen, did Vince force you to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.21,0:19:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.79,0:19:27.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,文斯没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vince didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.68,0:19:29.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不用逼我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wouldn't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.51,0:19:31.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.96,0:19:34.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让他看到  哄他开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}to show him, to make him happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.06,0:19:36.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就没想过  是什么样的变态才会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever stop and wonder what kind of sicko
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.62,0:19:39.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把看着别人自残当作开心事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}gets happy off of watching somebody melonball their own flesh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.39,0:19:41.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别那么说文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't talk about Vince like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.16,0:19:45.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他有理由的  很好的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had a reason, a good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.73,0:19:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他肯定有\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must have.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.29,0:19:52.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他肯定能解释清楚一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure he can explain everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.03,0:19:57.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我能见见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I could just see him --
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.07,0:20:00.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得赶去演出\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to get to the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.82,0:20:02.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.86,0:20:08.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.85,0:20:13.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  今晚的演出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we're building an aura
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.89,0:20:16.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要制造神秘和秘密感\N{\fnArial\fs30}of mystery and exclusivity with tonight's show --
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.78,0:20:19.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地点保密  观众少  有选择性\N{\fnArial\fs30}undisclosed location, small, select audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.48,0:20:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁拿不到票跟谁拿得到票一样重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's as much about who doesn't get a ticket as who does.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.56,0:20:27.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可以让你在社交网络上达到"金耶"的量级\N{\fnArial\fs30}This could push your social media profile to Kimye levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.33,0:20:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁能拿到票\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who gets the tickets?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.65,0:20:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在网上抽取本地粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an online lottery of local fans,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.50,0:20:32.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但会倾向于美女心的死忠粉\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it'll tend towards the Ladyheart diehards.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.67,0:20:35.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-他们会更关注...  -我受够死忠了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They'll be more engaged - I've had my fill of the diehards.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.06,0:20:37.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们已经很爱我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They already love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.94,0:20:40.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宗教  名人  推特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Religion, celebrity, Twitter --
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.63,0:20:43.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,规则都是一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's all the same rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.44,0:20:46.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你的追随者不增加  就是在减少\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're not gaining followers, you're losing followers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.51,0:20:49.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚我要换一群听众  新粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a different crowd tonight. New fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.52,0:20:54.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  找新听众\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, getting a new audience
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.64,0:20:56.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对社交媒体曝光是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}is great for social media visibility,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.57,0:20:58.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对总体声势也是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is great for overall buzz,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.91,0:21:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他们很善变\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they're fickle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.14,0:21:04.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不在音乐上花钱  毫无忠心\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't spend any money on music. They have no loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.07,0:21:05.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想把他们的关注转化成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck translating their attention
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.61,0:21:06.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,专辑和门票的销售可不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}to album or ticket sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.94,0:21:08.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.81,0:21:12.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要新鲜血液\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want fresh blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.31,0:21:22.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.23,0:21:29.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,表演就在今晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the show is tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.75,0:21:30.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what she said.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.66,0:21:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法会唱歌  或演奏乐器吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can Lucifer even sing or play an instrument?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.22,0:21:35.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看笼子里不会有吉他入门教程\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt they offer Intro to Guitar in the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.94,0:21:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那才不重要  路西法逼那女人做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like it matters. What Lucifer made that woman do
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.49,0:21:40.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟音乐毫无关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}has got nothing to do with music.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.25,0:21:42.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是为了忠心  -什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's about devotion. - Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.33,0:21:45.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些渺小的人不会理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}You little people wouldn't undend,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.92,0:21:47.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我当过国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I've been a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.26,0:21:50.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人把你当作一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having people look at you like you're everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.07,0:21:52.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一旦他们信奉了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}knowing that once they buy in,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.51,0:21:55.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就可以让他们做任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can make them do anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.56,0:21:56.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那感觉令人陶醉\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's intoxicating.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.12,0:21:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太吓人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's super creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.26,0:22:01.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么这场音乐会  这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so this concert, all these people, what is --
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.54,0:22:04.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-路西法想做什么  -不是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- what is Lucifer planning to do? - Nothing good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.71,0:22:07.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-罗威娜...  -亲爱的老妈说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is Rowena - Dear Mother says
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.00,0:22:10.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等我们抓到路西法  她才会现身  之前不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}that once we catch Lucifer, she'll show, no sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.59,0:22:12.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有罗威娜  我们武力不足\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, without Rowena, we're outgunned.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.07,0:22:13.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有她  我们还是打不过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}With her, we're outgunned.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.24,0:22:15.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无所谓了  这是我们的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter, guys. This is our shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.58,0:22:18.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得查明他今晚在哪里演出\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just gotta find out where he's playing tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.22,0:22:19.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们开工吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.39,0:22:23.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,连我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mystery to even me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.33,0:22:26.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但即便我知道  我大概也不会告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though, even if I did know, I probably wouldn't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.03,0:22:30.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你甘愿拿我们利润颇丰的合作冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd threaten our very lucrative partnership
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.27,0:22:34.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维护一个过了气  染发失败的摇滚恐龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}for one over-the-hill, bad dye job rock dinosaur?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.41,0:22:37.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,文斯是棵摇钱树  哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm smelling money with Vince, bruh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.21,0:22:39.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是生意  克劳力  不必往心里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is business, Crowley. It's nothing personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.00,0:22:49.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, believe me,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.02,0:22:51.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很往心里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.46,0:22:53.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(死亡警报录音棚)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.38,0:22:55.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汤米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.16,0:22:59.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们里面见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, I'll meet you inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.06,0:23:05.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,探员  你怎么来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent. What are you doing here, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.63,0:23:07.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,调查文斯  跟之前一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Investigating Vince, same as before.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.08,0:23:11.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听说萝丝琳的事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear what happened to Roseleen?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.78,0:23:15.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  那事很糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that was, uh, it was awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.16,0:23:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是...她自残的  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, I mean, come on, man, she cut herself, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.89,0:23:20.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-又不是  -你清楚事情没那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It wasn't like... - You know that's not the whole truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.53,0:23:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道文斯已经不是文斯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know Vince isn't Vince.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.42,0:23:32.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是摇滚兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the brothers that rock together.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.13,0:23:35.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像美国的绿洲乐队\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're kind of like the American Oasis.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.01,0:23:38.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是用合成乐器\N{\fnArial\fs30}But with synths.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.09,0:23:40.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是啊  所以我们很潮的  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, right, so, you know, we're -- we're hip. - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.99,0:23:43.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-谁弹什么  -我弹键盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who plays what? - I'm on keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.19,0:23:44.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-他是鼓手  -吉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's on the drums. - ‭Guitar.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.74,0:23:47.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打鼓和吉他  我什么都会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drums and guitar. I pretty much do it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.25,0:23:51.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在网上看到你代理文斯·文森特\N{\fnArial\fs30}We saw online that you represent Vince Vincente.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.19,0:23:54.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们希望你能为我们做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were kind of hoping you could do for us
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.41,0:23:55.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为他做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}what you've done for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.26,0:23:58.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.06,0:24:00.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我同意见面只是因为你们的照片很帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took this meeting 'cause you looked hot in your pics,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.35,0:24:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我对你们没什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I am not feeling this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.66,0:24:04.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你吧  我们其实不是为了会面而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you know what? We're not actually here for a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.13,0:24:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,文斯今晚的表演  在哪举行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vince's show tonight -- where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.66,0:24:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.25,0:24:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你肯定发现了  文斯不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you must've noticed, Vince is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.39,0:24:17.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.94,0:24:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在惹地狱烈火  罗素\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're messing with hellfire, Russell.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.10,0:24:23.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须查明表演在哪举行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will find out where that show is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.48,0:24:25.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.94,0:24:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,否则  我就灭了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I will end you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.36,0:24:40.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,布丽吉塔  再给我拿杯绿色果汁来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brigitta, get me another green juice in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.26,0:24:41.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有礼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Namaste.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.23,0:24:44.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,演出在哪举行  汤米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the show, Tommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.55,0:24:47.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道文斯是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I don't know what the hell's going on with Vince, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.32,0:24:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们热曲的版税早就断流了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the royalties on our hits dried up years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.57,0:24:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有两个女儿在上大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got two daughters in college.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.54,0:24:55.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我看到了什么  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I saw, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.01,0:24:58.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不在乎谁会付出代价吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't care who pays the price?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.13,0:25:04.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.15,0:25:09.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,文斯让我不舒服  但他是我的雇主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vince gives me the skeeves, but he's a playing client.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.27,0:25:10.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  他是魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's the Devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.92,0:25:13.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  真魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, like, literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.30,0:25:15.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个公关\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in P.R.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.54,0:25:19.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我服务过性别歧视者  种族歧视者  甚至政客\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've worked for sexists, racists, even politicians.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.58,0:25:22.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的工作就是把魔鬼打造成圣徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}My job is making saints out of devils.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.24,0:25:23.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我绝不会损害他的利益\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way I'm threatening my reputation
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.84,0:25:26.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,败坏我自己的名声\N{\fnArial\fs30}by working against his interests.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.04,0:25:30.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们得离我远远的  否则我就大叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you need to take a step back or I start screaming. And
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.84,0:25:32.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在这样人流熙攘的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a crowded place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.60,0:25:35.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这样的妹子  你们这样的汉子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girl like me, two guys like you...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.74,0:25:37.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猜猜结果会怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess what happens next?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.73,0:25:41.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buh-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.10,0:25:46.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(贝拉克酒店)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.48,0:25:54.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说你吓住罗素了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you said you put the fear in Russell.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.97,0:25:56.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.81,0:25:59.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些瑜伽疯啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}These yoga types.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.86,0:26:01.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为已经震慑住他们了...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just when you think you've harshed their mellow...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.98,0:26:04.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在网上到处查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I've been looking everywhere online,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.31,0:26:07.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有人知道在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, uh... no one's linked the venue yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.91,0:26:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-不是吧  -怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Seriously? - ‭What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.62,0:26:16.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-哥  -闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dude. ‭- Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.06,0:26:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.41,0:26:24.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.22,0:26:26.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.08,0:26:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们无法\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we couldn't flip
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.05,0:26:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让文斯身边任何一个人开口\N{\fnArial\fs30}a single member of Vince's team.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.09,0:26:32.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪怕有大屠杀的威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even with the threat of mass murder,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.85,0:26:35.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些南加州的二逼也不肯做正确的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}these SoCal douchebags won't do the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.25,0:26:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是洛杉矶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Los Angeles.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.39,0:26:38.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what happens now?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.45,0:26:58.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从没见过这么多哭泣表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen so many crying emojis in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.15,0:26:59.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些没票的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people who didn't get in,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.86,0:27:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都在推特上哭爹喊娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're rending garments all over Twitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.94,0:27:05.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,八卦博客  社交媒体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gossip blogs, social media,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.47,0:27:08.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都在热烈猜测秘密重聚表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're on fire speculating about the secret reunion show.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.73,0:27:11.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-得票的呢  -激动死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And the winners? - ‭Thrilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.07,0:27:14.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果有新音乐可推出他们会更激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be more thrilled if we had new music to sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.99,0:27:15.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.30,0:27:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,文斯没去录音棚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vince was a no-show at the studio.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.00,0:27:23.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又没去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.73,0:27:25.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,缪斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The muse --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.80,0:27:28.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大概是去洗手间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}guess she took a powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.93,0:27:30.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放松  罗素\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, Russell.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.95,0:27:32.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚的表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight's show?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.65,0:27:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会大杀四方的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.65,0:27:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在你身上冒了险  文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took a chance on you, Vince.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.99,0:27:42.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个老迈  早已过了巅峰期的垃圾摇滚乐手\N{\fnArial\fs30}An aging, well-past-his-prime buttrocker.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.71,0:27:44.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须听话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will get in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.14,0:27:47.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,否则呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.64,0:27:49.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,否则我就都收回\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I take it all back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.87,0:27:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看你的合同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check your contract for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.50,0:27:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不听我的  我可以毁了美女心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't do what I say, I can bury Ladyheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.33,0:28:00.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I own you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.42,0:28:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是吗  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you? - ‭Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.02,0:28:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.89,0:28:20.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-哥们  -文斯  你做什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, man. - Vince, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.88,0:28:21.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.31,0:28:23.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,文斯  停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭Vince, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.60,0:28:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭Vince!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.68,0:28:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,里面见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you all inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.20,0:28:54.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vince!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.75,0:28:56.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vince!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.99,0:29:13.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁想找点乐子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's ready to have fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.42,0:29:15.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,文斯  我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vince, I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.65,0:29:17.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭Vince!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.95,0:29:20.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.13,0:29:22.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我爱你  文斯  -我辞职\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love you, Vince! - I quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.11,0:29:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(美女心  重聚演出)
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.98,0:30:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(碧昂斯探员  演出一小时后在流星俱乐部举行)
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.77,0:30:06.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.42,0:30:42.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汤米还是不接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tommy's still not answering.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.55,0:30:44.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他让我们找到地方了  这才重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he got us here. That's what matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.43,0:30:47.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天使语手铐  你就使这招\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enochian handcuffs. That's your move?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.61,0:30:49.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-对付我就够  -你不是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They held me. - ‭You're not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.93,0:30:51.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们无法保证什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no sure bets here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.59,0:30:53.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们用什么武器都会像BB弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything that we use is gonna be like popping BBs.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.99,0:30:56.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真会鼓舞士气  加油  小队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great pep talk. Go, team.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.71,0:30:58.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各位  我们不仅要抓住机会对付路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, we're here to do more than just take a shot at Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.97,0:31:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是吗  -是的  我们还得救里面的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We are? - ‭Yes, we need to save the people inside, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.74,0:31:04.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去对付路西法  他是我的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take Lucifer. He's my responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.25,0:31:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是的  他是我们所有人的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's not. He's all of our responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.62,0:31:09.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想顺利疏散那群人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the only way you'll clear that crowd without drawing fire
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.37,0:31:11.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就得让他无暇顾及\N{\fnArial\fs30}is if he's otherwise engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.18,0:31:13.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那让他顾及什么  小卡  杀你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engaged in what, Cass? Killing you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.17,0:31:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  你至多能撑个三分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, you'll last... three minutes tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.29,0:31:19.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我就替你们拖个三分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll buy you three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.14,0:31:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要四分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it four.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.55,0:31:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  我帮忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I help.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.96,0:31:39.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看到外面的人群了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen that crowd?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.48,0:31:43.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我上次见到这么激动的观众\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I have not seen an audience this hyped
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.09,0:31:46.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-还是91年我们是摇滚怪兽头牌的时候  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- since we headlined Monsters of Rock in '91, man. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.03,0:31:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有迷妹们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.16,0:31:51.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正值芳龄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect age.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.58,0:31:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汤米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.39,0:31:54.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.97,0:31:59.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们无畏的领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our fearless leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.42,0:32:06.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你对演出有什么感觉  汤米\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you feelin' about the show, Tommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.52,0:32:13.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.05,0:32:15.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.20,0:32:24.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来我今晚之前该练习一下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I should've practiced before tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.18,0:32:27.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是...有过一点练习也好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or, you know, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.74,0:32:28.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.01,0:32:31.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我曾经是谁  那不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who I was... well, that doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.50,0:32:33.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.77,0:32:37.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是文斯·文森特  摇滚上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm Vince Vincente, rock god.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.95,0:32:40.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,经过小心考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after careful deliberation,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.47,0:32:42.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我决定要摆脱累赘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've decided to cut the dead weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.14,0:32:44.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要单飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.29,0:32:48.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.78,0:32:55.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好久才来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took you long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.96,0:32:59.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其他小淘气你也带来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you bring the rest of the Little Rascals?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.06,0:33:03.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就我一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.13,0:33:05.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小胖墩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spanky.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.36,0:33:16.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.24,0:33:35.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们闻到烟味儿了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you guys -- you guys smell smoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.25,0:33:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一二三  文斯  文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three! Vince! Vince!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.40,0:33:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没想到你还会做个殉道士  克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did not take you for the martyr type, Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.95,0:33:47.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真不是  我就是有那么恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really not. I just hate you that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.34,0:33:58.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是想干什么  路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing, Lucifer?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.14,0:34:01.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你对外面那些孩子来说毫无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean nothing to those kids out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.84,0:34:04.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为他们会为你流血吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think they'd draw blood for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.18,0:34:05.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自愿流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}By choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.77,0:34:10.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得至少该问问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I'd at least ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.55,0:34:14.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们不肯自愿献出\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if they won't give it up by choice,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.50,0:34:19.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-那我就强夺  -为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- maybe I'll just take it. - ‭Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.29,0:34:20.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.13,0:34:23.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.92,0:34:25.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为做路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And because being Lucifer?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.08,0:34:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有太多基督宗教的包袱\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much Judeo-Christian baggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.47,0:34:32.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但文斯  他是个名人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Vince? He's famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.78,0:34:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人人都爱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody loves him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.12,0:34:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I need love.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.03,0:34:44.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的童年真的很不幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a really jacked childhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.89,0:34:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汤米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Tommy. ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.53,0:34:52.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think this is fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.16,0:34:55.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你不会理解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I wouldn't expect you to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.17,0:34:57.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我进入过你体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was inside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.24,0:34:59.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你是个怎样无趣  只知道责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what a weak, duty-bound... ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.60,0:35:02.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毫不知享乐的闷蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}pleasureless dullard you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.27,0:35:06.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.71,0:35:09.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坏狗狗  坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad doggy. Sit!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.68,0:35:16.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  说真的  好像有烟味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, seriously, I-I-I think I smell smoke, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.92,0:35:18.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,确定你不是中风了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure you're not having a stroke?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.24,0:35:19.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  我们得出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm serious. We need to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.88,0:35:22.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别碰我  老爷子  你什么毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step off, dad. What's your problem, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.56,0:35:23.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-别碰我  -我们得...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get off me! - We gotta --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.42,0:35:25.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-好了  -别让他碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, yeah. - Get this guy off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.06,0:35:26.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-听我说  -你什么毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, listen to me, okay? Listen, - What's your problem, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.65,0:35:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}we gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.74,0:35:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.13,0:35:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我们得把大家疏散出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Look, we gotta get everybody out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.49,0:35:47.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那俩丫头真聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clever girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.32,0:35:55.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.28,0:35:59.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.57,0:36:09.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,留下参加余兴派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stick around for the afterparty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.17,0:36:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们好  洛杉矶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, L.A.!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.89,0:36:38.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好一群观众\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}What a crowd!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.59,0:36:39.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你  文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Vince!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.46,0:36:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看这些新鲜的面孔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at all those fresh, new faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.60,0:36:46.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家激动吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone excited?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.68,0:36:48.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们是该激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you should be!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.68,0:36:50.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚不会是一般的演出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight's not gonna be a typical show.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.84,0:36:55.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚  你们将看到前所未见的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight, you're gonna see and feel things
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.75,0:36:58.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感受到前所未有的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}you never saw or felt before.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.83,0:37:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能会有些失控\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things might get a little bit messy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.51,0:37:05.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.64,0:37:11.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-他有枪  -我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's got a gun! - We gotta go! We gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.37,0:37:13.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快走  各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go! Come on, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.26,0:37:20.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.62,0:37:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.51,0:37:24.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.56,0:37:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, assbutt.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.11,0:37:47.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.70,0:37:51.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.34,0:37:53.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看得开心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy the show?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.71,0:38:01.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各位  你们知道我一个弹指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, you know I could end you all
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.75,0:38:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就能干掉你们所有人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a snap of my finger?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.76,0:38:06.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我为什么要那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I do that
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.59,0:38:08.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们对我\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you can't do anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.11,0:38:10.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么都做不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.69,0:38:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.01,0:38:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.14,0:38:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和上帝和好了  你原谅了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and God made up. You forgave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.28,0:38:19.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会怎么想啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would he think?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.89,0:38:22.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我并不是很想知道他的看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not especially interested in his opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.46,0:38:27.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的老爸  他终于为抛弃我道歉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear old dad, he finally apologized for abandoning me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.26,0:38:29.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他紧接着就做了什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what's the very next thing he does?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.15,0:38:33.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他抛下了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ditches me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.20,0:38:38.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也抛下了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, too, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.66,0:38:42.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟阿玛拉姑妈绝尘而去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And rides off into the sunset with Auntie Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.96,0:38:46.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他需要我帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needed my help,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.43,0:38:49.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就愿说任何甜言蜜语哄我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he'd say anything to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.75,0:38:53.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的话  你们的话  毫无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}His words, your words, they mean nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.37,0:38:59.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还不明白吗  这一切都毫无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you get it? This is all meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.62,0:39:01.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天堂  地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven, Hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.38,0:39:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.27,0:39:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果它曾有过意义  那一刻也过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it ever meant anything, that moment is past.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.54,0:39:15.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里只有一群只图一时消遣的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing down here but a bunch of hopeless distraction addicts,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.57,0:39:19.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如此空虚\N{\fnArial\fs30}so filled with emptiness,so
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.80,0:39:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如此渴望弥补空白\N{\fnArial\fs30}desperate to fill up the void...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.70,0:39:26.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}they don't mind being served
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.98,0:39:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看陈旧的翻新陈旧\N{\fnArial\fs30}another stale rerun of a rerun of a rerun.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.64,0:39:34.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我的计划是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what my plan is?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.81,0:39:37.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.93,0:39:42.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只想继续破坏老爸已经坏掉的玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just gonna keep on smashing Daddy's already broken toys
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.80,0:39:45.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,逼你们看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}and make you watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.46,0:39:47.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.45,0:39:50.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为看上去  你要不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause it kinda looks like you're falling apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.83,0:39:53.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  你这里有点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you got a little something, uh, right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.04,0:39:56.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,承认吧  摇滚已死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, face it, rock is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.94,0:39:58.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.12,0:40:02.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,揍你是很耗费体力的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kicking your ass took a lot out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.61,0:40:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.60,0:40:07.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,勇往直前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Onward and upward.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.23,0:40:34.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}How you feelin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.62,0:40:35.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.81,0:40:38.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I gotta hand it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.34,0:40:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说过会引开路西法的火力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you were gonna draw Lucifer's fire
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.60,0:40:41.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还真是没少挨揍\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you drew some serious fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.49,0:40:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  大获成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it was a grand success.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.66,0:40:49.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没抓到路西法  但我们救了那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we didn't catch Lucifer, but we did save the crowd,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.62,0:40:51.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这算赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I'm gonna call that a win.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.18,0:40:52.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.40,0:40:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,文斯·文森特死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vince Vincente is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.49,0:40:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们根本没指望能救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We never even hoped to save him. ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.16,0:41:00.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我知道  第三张专辑\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, yes, I know, the third album --
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.18,0:41:02.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  他始终是个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he was still a person,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.77,0:41:04.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且他对很多人有些意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he meant something to a lot of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.99,0:41:05.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(摇滚明星文斯·文森特死亡)
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.53,0:41:07.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法扭曲了那一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Lucifer just took all that and just twisted all that up
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.94,0:41:09.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后毁灭了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}and snuffed it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.05,0:41:14.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法有计划  有动机时就够糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer was bad enough when he had a plan, a motive.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.22,0:41:16.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在他只是想找乐子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now he's just having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.81,0:41:18.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚死了多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how many people died tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.98,0:41:22.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这一切  都是我们的责任  是我们放他出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Them, this, it's all on us. We let him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.11,0:41:24.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没有赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.27,0:41:27.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在慢慢地输\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just losing slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.84,0:41:29.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听到他的话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you heard what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.09,0:41:31.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,勇往直前  他要玩得更大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Onwards and upwards. He's gone big.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.92,0:41:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且不会停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he'll go bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.04,0:41:35.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会阻止他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we will stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.52,0:41:38.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.63,0:41:41.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what we do, man.

